    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture high‑resolution photos and video of the vehicle’s exterior, interior, and undercarriage from every angle. Store the media in a timestamped digital log and share it with the client to confirm the car’s pre‑load state, which is essential for any car transport via train claim process.</p>
