    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Reduce fuel levels to no more than 25 % of tank capacity. This lowers the vehicle’s weight, reduces fire hazards, and complies with railway safety guidelines for vehicle transport in train consignments. Note the exact fuel reading in the loading report.</p>
