    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag and documentation management</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Ensure the vehicle’s FASTag is deactivated or removed, and keep the tag and registration documents in a sealed envelope. Attach a barcode label linking the envelope to the digital audit, enabling real‑time car delivery status updates through the transport provider’s portal.</p>
